The main reasons for accidents are when the driver gets[ distracted]. This results in the driver ignoring the road and what is in front. Usually the main[ distractions] are[ phone calls], text messages, smartphone usage, looking somewhere else and meddling with the radio. These accidents are dangerous as well. The driver may hit[ a] bystand[er].
